50ait7L8b-ohFSNWNYcmYdMcnrFAsNhtKCsbTtNaXEwJJ13XFZspiwldjE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKv_Qnxx2_fbFn4ZSv-bz6CNapeCbG2nhEB6lfObpG-2A&oe=6AA417F4"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "SplatterVault", "keywords": ["splattervault", "dedicated", "server"], "long_description": "**Your SplatterVault command center, built for Quest.**\n\nSplatterVault is a companion app that gives you full control over your on-demand dedicated game servers without leaving VR. Designed for Seamless Multitasking, it runs as a 2D panel alongside your favorite VR games.\n\n**Features:**\n- Launch and manage dedicated game servers in seconds\n- Track your credit balance and session usage in real time\n- Coordinate with your team \u2014 view rosters, matchups, scrims, and practices\n- Browse and configure games from the full SplatterVault catalog\n- Switch between personal and organization accounts\n- Share active sessions with teammates via invite links\n\n**Built for VR players, by VR players.**\nSplatterVault powers on-demand dedicated servers for competitive and casual VR gaming. This companion app keeps you connected to your servers and team while you play.\n\nRequires a SplatterVault account at splattervault.com.", "short_description": "Manage your SplatterVault game servers directly from Quest. Launch sessions, track credits, coordinate with your team, and monitor matchups \u2014 all without leaving VR."}]}, "developer_name": "VYRX", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://splattervault.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "VYRX", "support_website_url": "https://splattervault.com/faq", "website_url": "https://splattervault.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1063584910766706"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "ge